1
00:00:00,423 --> 00:00:02,063
(Bermadette:)Strike two.

2
00:00:04,327 --> 00:00:05,207
(Howard:)I'm copying Leonard.

3
00:00:05,261 --> 00:00:08,071
(Howard:)When he does this to Penny,
they have sex and watch Monty Python.

4
00:00:08,765 --> 00:00:10,545
-Howard!
-I know. It was dumb.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,670
(Howard:)I shouldn't have done it.
And it's making me feel sad.

6
00:00:14,771 --> 00:00:16,271
(Howard:)So sad.

7
00:00:18,842 --> 00:00:21,122
(Howard:)You know, why don't you take a bath?
I'll do the dishes.

8
00:00:24,948 --> 00:00:27,758
(Raj:)Three, two, one...

9
00:00:28,618 --> 00:00:29,758
(Sheldon:)That's it.

10
00:00:29,853 --> 00:00:32,193
(Stuart:)Our dating profiles are live
on the Internet.

11
00:00:32,255 --> 00:00:36,965
Attention all shoppers:
my business is open for business!

12
00:00:38,528 --> 00:00:40,438
(Stuart:)That's right, ladies.

13
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:44,270
(Stuart:)For all you know,
I'm confident and fun to be around.

14
00:00:46,269 --> 00:00:47,539
(COMPUTER CHIMES)

15
00:00:47,771 --> 00:00:50,911
(Raj:)Oh, cool, it tells you
when someone's reading your profile.

16
00:00:50,974 --> 00:00:53,784
"Jenny309."

17
00:00:54,377 --> 00:00:55,947
(Raj:)I hope that's not her weight.

18
00:00:57,781 --> 00:01:02,021
If it is, I'll... I'll take her.

